   "subject": "Survival analysis in INLA",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "I am running a proportional hazard survival model where the outcome is (dead=1, alive=0) and a list of covariates. below is my model to establish risk factors.<div>below is my output also. My question is, (1) how do i interpret the coefficients (2) can i transform them to odds ratios and (3) Can i use the 2.5% and 97.5% to talk of significane of each covariate? </div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(0,36,81);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:10.6667px;color:rgb(235,187,255);white-space:pre\"> model1</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(0,36,81);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:10.6667px;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(235,187,255)\"> &lt;- joint(formSurv = surv.obj ~ Sex+age_cut2+Occupation_type+Hypertension+Diabetes+chest_cough_1+Chest_Xray_Abnormal, basRisk = &quot;rw1&quot;,NbasRisk = 3, dataSurv = cox_data)</span><br></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:10.6667px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(255,255,255);background-color:rgb(0,36,81);white-space:pre-wrap\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(235,187,255)\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(0,36,81);color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:10.6667px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Survival outcome</span><br></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:10.6667px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(255,255,255);background-color:rgb(0,36,81);white-space:pre-wrap\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=